          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='87534' id='48' type-v2='text' w='10596' x='499' y='11394'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Most requests came during the morning (48%) and evening (39%) shifts, yet CSAT was highest for Split and Afternoon shifts (4.43 and 4.29).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='8'>Email, though the least-used channel (3.5%), had the lowest CSAT (3.90), while Inbound and Outcall had higher satisfaction scores (4.25 and 4.27).</run>
